---
source: src/cli/mod.rs
surface: memory_hook_boundary
assertion: ee does not expose or generate a bash command-interception hook
contracts:
  - ee hook preflight-shell --shell bash is rejected as an unknown command
  - ee hook --help does not advertise preflight-shell
  - no public library generator emits a bash DEBUG trap
  - ee preflight check remains an explicit advisory memory query
evidence:
  - tests/preflight_hook_bash.rs::bash_preflight_shell_interceptor_is_not_a_public_command
  - tests/preflight_hook_bash.rs::explicit_preflight_memory_query_remains_available
